# CODEOWNERS for the QbitOS workspace.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Each line: <path-pattern> <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Owners can be GitHub usernames (@alice) or team names (@org/team).
# The last matching pattern takes precedence.

# ─── Default ownership ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Any file not matched by a more specific pattern below is owned by the
# maintainers team. They are responsible for the overall workspace coherence.
*                           @qbitos/maintainers

# ─── Workspace & DevOps ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/                   @qbitos/maintainers @qbitos/devops
/.github/workflows/         @qbitos/devops
/Dockerfile                 @qbitos/devops
/docker-compose.yml         @qbitos/devops
/.dockerignore              @qbitos/devops
/scripts/                   @qbitos/devops
/config/                    @qbitos/devops
/deploy/                    @qbitos/devops
/Cargo.toml                 @qbitos/maintainers
/Cargo.lock                 @qbitos/maintainers
/rust-toolchain.toml        @qbitos/maintainers

